      "ChannelId": "UCiZeuI-7OPs7TmMel6Q5Msw",
      "ChannelTitle": "Kanishk Nishar",
      "Description": "Another recording off the radio from the weekly broadcast of the NY Philharmonic. This broadcast from 1954 is introduced by Jim Fassett as Mozart\u0027s Piano Concerto No 14 in Eb Major, K. 449. English pianist Dame Myra Hess plays this impressive piece conducted by German conductor Bruno Walter. \n\nTechnical information: \n7\u0022 Cine Reel \nScotch - unknown type of tape\n7 1/2 IPS\nAs typical with these recordings in the archive it gets distorted in the loudest parts but sounds great otherwise. \n\n\n00:00 - Intro by Jim Fassett\n02:43 - Allegro vivace\n10:05 - Andantino\n18:49 - Allegro ma non troppo",
